# ADR 0017 Tier-1 (upstream-PENDING backport, INTERIM): backported verbatim
# from the still-open upstream PR zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr#119301
# @ d81b1f630ee0f5078de6e3a47e7bc1b3613424c2 -- not in the pinned Zephyr v4.4.1
# base yet. Delete this file (and ov5647.c, dts/bindings/video/ovti,ov5647.yaml,
# the CMake/Kconfig hookup) the moment the Zephyr pin advances past a revision
# containing #119301; see zephyr/drivers/video/ov5647.c and
# docs/adr/0017-alp-sdk-over-the-vendor-sdk.md.
